# Jira ticket → Gherkin test cases

When the user asks to **generate test cases**, **write scenarios**, **create a test plan**, or similar for a **Jira ticket** (e.g. DS-1):

1. Read and follow `.agents/skills/jira-ticket-to-gherkin/SKILL.md` completely (fetch the ticket via Atlassian MCP, cover every acceptance criterion, add negative and edge cases, save to `features/<ticket-key>.feature`).
2. Do not skip the skill in favor of ad-hoc scenarios.
3. Do not write Playwright code unless the user explicitly asks after the feature file is approved.
